{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0532"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",112],["-","arrived"],["+","met"],["=",1],["-","with"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","actor Owen Wilson at the University of Texas at Austin, where the two were roommates, and their friendship became his first writing partnership. Together they wrote "],["=",4],["-","and"],["+","(1996),"],["=",1],["-","„Rushmore“"],["+","Anderson's"],["=",1],["-","and"],["+","first"],["=",1],["+","feature film, about three friends out to pull off the big heist, expanded from a short of the same name made in 1994; "],["=",2],["+","came „Rushmore“ (1998). From there Anderson "],["=",34],["-","(2001)"],["+","(2001),"],["=",1],["+","the third script he shared with Wilson and an Oscar nominee for its screenplay, "],["=",68],["-","writes"],["+","has"],["=",1],["-","his"],["+","since"],["=",1],["-","scripts"],["+","written"],["=",9],["-","Owen Wilson, "],["=",10],["+","and Owen Wilson keeps appearing in his films, "],["=",651]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",110],["-","kam"],["+","lernte"],["=",3],["+","an der University of Texas in Austin den Schauspieler Owen Wilson kennen, "],["=",2],["+","dem er sich ein Zimmer teilte, und aus der Freundschaft wurde seine erste Schreibpartnerschaft. Gemeinsam schrieben sie "],["=",4],["-","und"],["+","(1996),"],["=",1],["+","Andersons ersten Spielfilm über drei Freunde, die auf den ganz großen Coup aus sind – entstanden aus einem gleichnamigen Kurzfilm von 1994; danach kam "],["=",2],["-","und"],["+","(1998)."],["=",1],["+","Von dort aus "],["=",2],["-","dann"],["+","Anderson"],["=",31],["-","(2001)"],["+","(2001),"],["=",1],["+","das dritte Drehbuch mit Wilson und für einen Drehbuch-Oscar nominiert, "],["=",66],["-","Anderson"],["+","Seither"],["=",3],["-","seine"],["+","Anderson"],["=",1],["-","Drehbücher "],["=",6],["-","Owen Wilson, "],["=",10],["+","und Owen Wilson taucht immer wieder in seinen Filmen auf, "],["=",593]]}]},
